      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Herbie Nayokpuk, known as the 'Shishmaref Cannonball,' finished the Iditarod many times, including a second-place finish.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shishmaref%2C_Alaska",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Erosion at Shishmaref, driven by melting permafrost and rising seas, has been receding up to 10 feet per year, threatening homes and infrastructure.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20,
        21,
        22,
        23,
