      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shishmaref%2C_Alaska",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Shishmaref plans to relocate several miles south to Tin Creek, but the site was rejected because melting permafrost made it unsuitable, so a relocation coalition seeks funding.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28,
        29,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shishmaref%2C_Alaska",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Shishmaref lies within the Bering Land Bridge National Preserve, a protected area preserving the historic land bridge that once connected Asia and North America.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shishmaref%2C_Alaska",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Sarichef Island, where Shishmaref sits, is part of a 100‑km-long barrier island chain that records 2,000 years of human and environmental history.",
